  "description": "This is your chance to get your SEGO!\nAfter three Years of R&D, the Sego is finaly ready for production! This pure bread race machine has been developed with a pure focus on speed. Thus, a lot of \"conventional\" standards and techniques were questioned and re-imagined in order to create a package that can follow along the name of the bike. Sego translated into english means \"to win\"!\nTeam Build:\n– Gamux Sego Frame\n– Pinion Gearbox\n– Gates Carbon Drive\n– Manitou Dorado Pro\n– Manitou Mara Pro\n– Hayes Dominion A4 (black)\n– Protaper Cockpit & Seatpost\n– Reynolds BL309 DH EXP or BL307 DH EXP\n– Schwalbe DH Tires\n– Ergon Grips & Saddle\nThe Sego is manufactured in batches. There may be a waiting period after your order until you receive your bike. Please get in touch with us to get precise information.\n\n- Shipment costs will be calculated individually and invoiced before delivery.\n- Bikes are only sold in Europe for the moment. Thank you for understanding.\n*Production bike may differ from these pictures",
